    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 5th level, when a creature ends its turn within 15 feet of you, you can use your reaction to move up to half your speed to a space closer to the creature. Moving in this way doesn't provoke opportunity attacks.</p><p>Additionally, you have advantage on the first attack you make against the creature before the end of your next turn.</p>",
